(global_label "CHG_BIAS" (shape passive) (at 558.8 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "c885fc4e-99ab-5b3e-979e-8dc0cc5a9cfd"))
(text "CHARGE-PERMIT-01 v0.2 - latch + CD signal actuator; complete charger NOT qualified" (at 25.4 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4d0f891-9442-53a3-bd45-e59dfd369ae9"))
(text "FAULT_BUS_N LOW clears Q even with ARM HIGH. Releasing fault alone does not re-arm.\nD and PRE tied HIGH. Only a new ARM rising edge after reset recovery may set Q. Q-bar intentionally unused.\nExternal fault sources / MCU revoke must sink or release; never drive shared bus HIGH." (at 25.4 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df065ae8-0cfd-50dd-b219-4bca92bdd51f"))
(text "FAULT LOW: U405 selects CHG_BIAS directly, even when Q is unknown.\nFAULT HIGH: U405 passes U404 output. CD LOW requires Q HIGH.\nSupervisor and both muxes use CHG_BIAS; U401/U402 use AUX.\nJ401 changed to 4 pins. J404 is now active-HIGH CD, NOT PERMIT_Q." (at 25.4 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2e07ac1a-864e-5d60-bdaf-cb67e8b90359"))
(text "CHG_BIAS proposal: qualified charger-input rail 4.5..5.5V. Existing TPS25200 may clamp at 5.55V: NOT yet compatible.\nAUX 3.0..3.6V; SENSE falling nominal 3.07V. Delays/fast ramps/bias loss and restart still require measurement.\nNo MCU, watchdog, INA300 or charger power stage here. This sheet does not authorize battery connection." (at 25.4 391.16 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "efedc136-d398-509b-950b-161c0de4b34e"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
